debdeck (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial public release.
  * Add a native APT/dpkg catalog, package details and installed-file browser.
  * Add application launch, uninstall, version hold, APT package download and
    offline package rebuild actions.
  * Add a local .deb installation flow with an in-application polkit agent.

